{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x04---itchy-scratchy-land",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x04 - Itchy & Scratchy Land",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x04 - Itchy & Scratchy Land.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:00.282Z",
  "lineCount": 230,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Itchy and Scratchy Land",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 2135,
      "endMs": 3537
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Thanks, kids. Now I'd like to speak to you seriously for a moment.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 66834,
      "endMs": 70304
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Yep. This week is the grand opening of Itchy & Scratchy Land.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 70470,
      "endMs": 73607
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "The violentest place on Earth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 73774,
      "endMs": 76243
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "And to celebrate, for this week only, we're cutting ticket prices in half.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 76410,
      "endMs": 81181
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Kids, you heard the cartoon rat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 85953,
      "endMs": 87721
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "If you haven't already run to your parents begging to go, do it now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 87888,
      "endMs": 91024
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "You won't miss anything funny. I'll just be sitting here...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 91191,
      "endMs": 93927
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "...reading this grownups� newspaper.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 94094,
      "endMs": 96964
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Go now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 98499,
      "endMs": 99800
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Dad, remember how you said that going to Itchy & Scratchy Land...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100000,
      "endMs": 103003
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "...would be too damned expensive?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 103170,
      "endMs": 104771
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Oh, everything's too damn expensive these days.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 104938,
      "endMs": 107207
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Look at this Bible I just got, 15 bucks. And talk about a preachy book.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 107374,
      "endMs": 112513
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Everybody's a sinner, except for this guy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 112679,
      "endMs": 115616
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "But now Itchy & Scratchy Land is cutting ticket prices in half.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 115782,
      "endMs": 118919
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Can we go, Dad? Can we, can we, can we? Take it, Lis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 119086,
      "endMs": 121488
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Can we? No, no, no. Ask your mother.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 121655,
      "endMs": 124458
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Mom, guess what. We're going to Itchy & Scratchy Land.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 126960,
      "endMs": 130531
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "No. I've already planned our vacation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 130697,
      "endMs": 133433
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "We're going to the Highway 9 bird sanctuary.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133634,
      "endMs": 136570
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "I understand they've installed a new bird feeder this year.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 136737,
      "endMs": 140240
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "It's shaped like a diner. And it's on this really tall pole.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141408,
      "endMs": 146013
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Mom, Dad, Bart's dead!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 151644,
      "endMs": 154144
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "That's right. Dead serious about going to Itchy & Scratchy Land.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 155411,
      "endMs": 158973
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "You know, Itchy & Scratchy Land isn't just for kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159863,
      "endMs": 162740
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "They have a place called Parents' Island.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 162877,
      "endMs": 165788
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Yeah. Dancing, bowling, fashionable shops, over 100 bars and saloons...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 165959,
      "endMs": 170240
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "...and a world-class chemical-dependency center.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170377,
      "endMs": 173390
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "TV Town. Hammock Land!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 173527,
      "endMs": 176267
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "\"Recipe-related bumper cars.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176438,
      "endMs": 178870
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Wait a minute. I'm not sure about this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 183425,
      "endMs": 185856
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Every time we've ever gone on vacation, I end up being horribly embarrassed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 186062,
      "endMs": 189589
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "We have a big fight and we come home more miserable than when we left.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 189795,
      "endMs": 192945
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "You have to promise me that this isn't gonna happen this time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 193082,
      "endMs": 195925
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Embarrassed? What do you mean? Well, our trip to the Amish country.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196130,
      "endMs": 200582
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Oh, yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 200719,
      "endMs": 202603
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Hey, look, Marge. They're still not fighting back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203733,
      "endMs": 206507
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "I can be a jerk and no one can stop me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 207603,
      "endMs": 210925
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Even worse was our trip to Sandy Beach.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 212844,
      "endMs": 215180
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Suckers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 221454,
      "endMs": 223056
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Sharkboy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 224657,
      "endMs": 226726
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "This year I want us to do things together as a family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 228128,
      "endMs": 230597
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "And get a lot of good exercise outdoors...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 230764,
      "endMs": 232800
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "...so we'll have a lot of wonderful memories of our vacation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232900,
      "endMs": 236104
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Don't worry, Mom. We'll make you proud of us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 236270,
      "endMs": 238573
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Lobster hat, fishnet Speedo Jr., wheelie shoes...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 238773,
      "endMs": 242811
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "...invisible-dog leash.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 242978,
      "endMs": 244880
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Well, I'm packed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 246148,
      "endMs": 247250
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Remember, every morning, give a bowl of kibble...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 247450,
      "endMs": 249686
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "...to Santa's Little Helper. Do you want me to write this down?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 249886,
      "endMs": 252923
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "No. I ain't senile, dad blast it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 253090,
      "endMs": 255726
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Okay, bye-bye. Bye, Grampa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255893,
      "endMs": 258396
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Wait a minute. What was that last thing you said?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258496,
      "endMs": 261132
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Grampa's Little Helper? What's that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 261265,
      "endMs": 265170
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Which one of you is the mailman?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 265470,
      "endMs": 268340
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Okay, let's make a pact. This is gonna be the best vacation ever...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 269875,
      "endMs": 273312
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "...or we'll all agree to disband and join other families.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273479,
      "endMs": 276549
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Agreed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276716,
      "endMs": 277717
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "The interstate. Fasten your seatbelts, kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279186,
      "endMs": 281722
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "We're on our way to Itchy & Scratchy Land.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 281889,
      "endMs": 284892
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Don't worry. I've got an ace up my sleeve.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286895,
      "endMs": 290532
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Now to absorb some local color through the magic of AM radio.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 295811,
      "endMs": 299932
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "The book of Revelation tells us to watch for the seven signs of evil.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 300473,
      "endMs": 304899
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Sign of evil number four...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 306014,
      "endMs": 307939
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Continuing our sign-of-evil countdown, here's Vanessa Williams.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 308108,
      "endMs": 312027
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Haven't we stood in five different states long enough?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 315203,
      "endMs": 318581
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 318750,
      "endMs": 320270
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "We better find a motel and stop for the night.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329257,
      "endMs": 331419
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "We don't need to do that, Marge. I'm not tired. I'm not tired at all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 331622,
      "endMs": 335980
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Glad that wasn't us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340946,
      "endMs": 342399
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "North, south. Nuts to this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 344324,
      "endMs": 347466
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "I'm gonna take a shortcut. Homer, no. You're gonna get lost.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 347601,
      "endMs": 351115
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Trust me, Marge. With today's modern cars, you can't get lost.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 351318,
      "endMs": 355101
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "What with all the silicon chips and such.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 355304,
      "endMs": 357736
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "All right, we're here. Let us never speak of the shortcut again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367399,
      "endMs": 370946
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Now remember, we're in the Itchy Lot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 371115,
      "endMs": 374122
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "We're now approaching our final destination, Itchy & Scratchy Land.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 378480,
      "endMs": 381689
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "The amusement park of the future where nothing can possib-lie go wrong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 381858,
      "endMs": 385405
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Possibly go wrong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386655,
      "endMs": 388277
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "That's the first thing that's ever gone wrong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 389054,
      "endMs": 391689
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "One adult and four children.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 407804,
      "endMs": 409696
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Do you want to buy some Itchy & Scratchy money?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 409797,
      "endMs": 411926
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "What's that? Money that's made for the park.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 412162,
      "endMs": 414324
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "It works just like regular money, but it's fun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 414493,
      "endMs": 417399
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Do it, Dad. Well, okay. If it's fun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 417568,
      "endMs": 420338
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Let's see. I'll take $ 1100 worth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420507,
      "endMs": 423480
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Cool, that is neato. Oh, wow. Cool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 433885,
      "endMs": 436081
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Such a violent motif.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 436216,
      "endMs": 438547
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Yeah, but it's just pretend violence, which is actually beneficial for children.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 438716,
      "endMs": 442297
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "There's no need to murmur, ma'am. Here at Itchy & Scratchy Land...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 446250,
      "endMs": 449493
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "...we're just as concerned about violence as you are.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 449628,
      "endMs": 452432
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "That's why we're always careful to show the consequences...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 452635,
      "endMs": 455304
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "...of deadly mayhem so that we may educate as well as horrify.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 455574,
      "endMs": 458412
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "When do you show the consequences?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 458615,
      "endMs": 460304
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "On TV, that mouse pulled out the cat's lungs...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 460405,
      "endMs": 462568
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "...and played them like a bagpipe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 462635,
      "endMs": 464291
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "In the next scene, the cat's breathing comfortably.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 464459,
      "endMs": 466554
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Just like in real life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 466757,
      "endMs": 467872
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Hey, look over there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468649,
      "endMs": 470034
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "A brain burger with extra pus, please. Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474020,
      "endMs": 476318
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Eyeball stew. Homer. We just got here...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476486,
      "endMs": 478480
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "...and already I'm mortified beyond belief by your embarrassing behavior.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 478716,
      "endMs": 482061
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "I was just ordering a cheeseburger. They have violent names for everything here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 482230,
      "endMs": 485878
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Oh, I see. All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 486081,
      "endMs": 489459
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "I'll have the baby guts. Lady, you disgust me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 490473,
      "endMs": 494122
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Mom, that's veal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 495135,
      "endMs": 496858
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "You sure she'll have fun here? Of course. Babies love the ball room.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 501776,
      "endMs": 506298
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Torture Land, Explosion Land...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 516214,
      "endMs": 519464
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "...Searing Gas Pain Land, Unnecessary Surgery Land.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 519598,
      "endMs": 525662
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Oh, look. It's the 12 noon robot parade.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 526399,
      "endMs": 529045
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Hurry up or we'll have to wait for the 12:05 parade.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 529213,
      "endMs": 531692
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Wow, this is so much like my dreams, it's scary.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 551725,
      "endMs": 555511
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Look at that cute little baby ax.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559732,
      "endMs": 562010
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "It's cute, but I'm sure it's very sharp and probably dirty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 564657,
      "endMs": 567873
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Dirty, maybe. Dangerous, hardly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 569012,
      "endMs": 571524
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "These are state-of-the-art animatronic robots.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571658,
      "endMs": 574070
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "They have sensors that ensure they only attack each other, never the guests.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 574305,
      "endMs": 578760
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "See all that stuff in there, Homer? That's why your robot never worked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 592898,
      "endMs": 597152
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "This is just what I was hoping for, spending the day together as a family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606030,
      "endMs": 610285
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "You know, part of spending time together as a family...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 628040,
      "endMs": 631390
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "...is spending time apart as individuals.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 631558,
      "endMs": 633970
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Parents' Island?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 634104,
      "endMs": 635410
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "I'm sure we'll appreciate each other more when we meet up at dinner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 635578,
      "endMs": 638660
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Are you kids gonna be all right? Kids?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 639440,
      "endMs": 642254
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "It is the '70s. Right down to the smallest detail.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 650529,
      "endMs": 654080
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Hey, the bartender even looks like John Travolta.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654247,
      "endMs": 656592
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Yeah, \"looks like.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 656793,
      "endMs": 658703
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Look at all this great stuff, Lis. Cool. Personalized plates.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 660244,
      "endMs": 664365
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Barclay, Barry, Bert... Bort?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 664566,
      "endMs": 668418
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Come on. \"Bort\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 668586,
      "endMs": 670127
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Mommy, buy me a license plate. No. Come along, Bort.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 670328,
      "endMs": 673644
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Are you talking to me? No. My son is also named Bort.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 673845,
      "endMs": 677162
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Who are all these characters? You're too young to remember...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 677296,
      "endMs": 680278
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "...the short-lived Itchy & Scratchy & Friends Hour. They had to have friends.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 680445,
      "endMs": 684298
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "There's Disgruntled Goat, Uncle Ant, Ku Klux Klam.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 684499,
      "endMs": 687346
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Oh, yeah. They weren't very funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 689524,
      "endMs": 690931
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "I don't know. Disgruntled Goat had his moments.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 691132,
      "endMs": 693075
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Welcome to T.G.I. McScratchy's, where it's constantly New Year's Eve.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 708586,
      "endMs": 713845
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Here we go again. Three, two, one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714046,
      "endMs": 720010
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "It must be wonderful to ring in the new year over and over and over.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 728349,
      "endMs": 732549
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Please kill me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 732749,
      "endMs": 734589
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Roger Meyers Sr., the gentle genius behind Itchy and Scratchy...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 746210,
      "endMs": 750410
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "...loved and cared about almost all the peoples of the world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 750650,
      "endMs": 753651
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "And he in return was beloved by the world...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 753851,
      "endMs": 756651
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "...except in 1938, when he was criticized for his controversial cartoon...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 756811,
      "endMs": 761331
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "...\"Nazi Supermen Are Our Superiors.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761531,
      "endMs": 764371
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Among his proudest achievements was the full-length musical Scratchtasia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764571,
      "endMs": 768851
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Hey, Ma, I'm gonna get me a picture of this crazy critter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820333,
      "endMs": 824253
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "No flash photography, please.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 827094,
      "endMs": 829334
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Roger Meyers� next full-length feature was the wildly successful Pinitchio.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 833494,
      "endMs": 837934
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Now, you be a good Pinitchio, and don't you lie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 838174,
      "endMs": 842934
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "I promise I will never hurt you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 843094,
      "endMs": 845374
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "I wonder if this kind of violence really does desensitize us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 846934,
      "endMs": 850214
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Wanna get a snow cone? Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 855015,
      "endMs": 856975
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "So, Mr. Itchy, you think you're God's gift to women, do you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 861775,
      "endMs": 866415
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Don't do it, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 866615,
      "endMs": 867775
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "I just wanted to entertain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875415,
      "endMs": 877656
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Can you believe I keep getting away with this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 878736,
      "endMs": 881496
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Officer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882376,
      "endMs": 884336
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Mop-and-bucket man to the exit of the Nauseator.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 890696,
      "endMs": 892936
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Another jumper on the roof of T.G.I. McScratchy's.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 893096,
      "endMs": 895376
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "We need more Bort license plates in the gift shop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 895496,
      "endMs": 898136
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "I repeat, we are sold out of Bort license plates.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 898296,
      "endMs": 901617
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "I really wish they wouldn't scream.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 904177,
      "endMs": 905697
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Dad? I kicked one of those...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 909337,
      "endMs": 911377
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "...stupid Itchy characters in the butt. - Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 911537,
      "endMs": 914217
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "There's just no way to resist it, is there?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 914417,
      "endMs": 916337
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "I want all five T-shirts to say \"best vacation ever.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917977,
      "endMs": 921497
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Attention, Marge Simpson. Your son has been arrested.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 921577,
      "endMs": 924897
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "I'd be terribly embarrassed if I were that boy's mother.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 926057,
      "endMs": 928698
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Attention, Marge Simpson. We've also arrested your older, balder, fatter son.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 931238,
      "endMs": 936198
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "I'm so embarrassed, I wish there was a hole I could just crawl into and die.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 940038,
      "endMs": 943878
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Okay, throw her in the hole. Please. It was just a figure of speech.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944078,
      "endMs": 947798
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "You've got to listen to me. Elementary chaos theory tells us...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 951078,
      "endMs": 954359
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "...that all robots will eventually turn against their masters and run amok...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 954559,
      "endMs": 958319
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "...in an orgy of blood and kicking and the biting with the metal teeth...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958439,
      "endMs": 962119
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "...and the hurting and shoving. - How much time do we have, professor?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 962279,
      "endMs": 965479
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "According to my calculations, the robots won't go berserk for at least 24 hours.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965679,
      "endMs": 970799
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Oh, I forgot to carry the one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 974839,
      "endMs": 977359
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "I have nothing to say to you. But, Marge, I was a political prisoner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 977559,
      "endMs": 981160
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "How are you a political prisoner? I kicked a giant mouse in the butt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 981360,
      "endMs": 984920
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Do I have to draw you a diagram?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985080,
      "endMs": 987600
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Oh, for gosh sakes. What now?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 988200,
      "endMs": 990440
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Hey, look. This one's coming on to me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 999600,
      "endMs": 1002761
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Mr. Robot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004041,
      "endMs": 1006201
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "You're wrong about that robot trying to be your friend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1012561,
      "endMs": 1015161
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Lisa, don't contradict your elders.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1015281,
      "endMs": 1018681
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "My hair. You chopped off my hair. Oh, God, I'm ugly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1019681,
      "endMs": 1023961
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "I knew we should've gone to the bird sanctuary.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1024121,
      "endMs": 1026561
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "I need the biggest seed bell you have.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1031962,
      "endMs": 1035122
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "No, that's too big.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1035802,
      "endMs": 1038002
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "A chopper. We're saved.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1040002,
      "endMs": 1041322
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Hey, you're the guys who didn't like our capering.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1042162,
      "endMs": 1044722
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "When you get to hell, tell them Itchy sent you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1044882,
      "endMs": 1047522
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Oh, my. It looks like we're doomed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051562,
      "endMs": 1054043
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Back, you robot. Nobody ruins my family vacation but me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1054363,
      "endMs": 1058483
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "And maybe the boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1058723,
      "endMs": 1060363
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Dad, the flash must have scrambled their circuits.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1079724,
      "endMs": 1081364
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "What are you, the narrator? Just keep taking pictures.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1081564,
      "endMs": 1085204
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "I'll get more cameras!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086444,
      "endMs": 1087764
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Smashy-smashy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1090924,
      "endMs": 1092524
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "I don't approve of that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1092724,
      "endMs": 1094964
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Hey, mouse. Say cheese.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1101364,
      "endMs": 1104045
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "With a dry, cool wit like that, I could be an action hero.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1105525,
      "endMs": 1108565
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Die, bad robots. Die!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1117765,
      "endMs": 1120005
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "With a dry, cool wit like that... Who'd think that visiting...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1121485,
      "endMs": 1124365
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "...Itchy & Scratchy Land would be our best vacation ever?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1124485,
      "endMs": 1127486
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Yeah, best ever. Are you two bonkers?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1127646,
      "endMs": 1131086
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "We almost got killed. Not to mention all the embarrassment I suffered.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1131166,
      "endMs": 1134646
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "But, Mom, it's exactly what you wanted in a vacation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1134806,
      "endMs": 1137246
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "It brought us together as a family, we got a lot of good exercise outdoors...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1137406,
      "endMs": 1141246
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "...and we have so many memories.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1141486,
      "endMs": 1143366
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "You know, you're right. This truly was the best vacation ever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1143806,
      "endMs": 1146966
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Now, let us never speak of it again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1147166,
      "endMs": 1148646
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "As Roger Meyers Jr., the owner of the park, I'd like to thank you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1150086,
      "endMs": 1153327
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "...for stopping the killer robots.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1153487,
      "endMs": 1155207
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "And to show my appreciation, here are two free passes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1155407,
      "endMs": 1158047
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "There are five of us. Here are two free passes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1158167,
      "endMs": 1160527
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "That's better. Man, if this is happening here...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1160767,
      "endMs": 1164047
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "...I hate to think what's happening in Euro-Itchy & Scratchy Land.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1164247,
      "endMs": 1167647
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Hello. Itchy & Scratchy Land, open for business.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1172427,
      "endMs": 1176067
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Who are you to resist it, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1176627,
      "endMs": 1179228
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Come on, my last paycheck bounced.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1179388,
      "endMs": 1182228
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "My children need wine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1182388,
      "endMs": 1184468
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "I hope you realize now that violence on TV may be funny...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1192788,
      "endMs": 1195588
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "...but it's not so funny when that violence is happening to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1195748,
      "endMs": 1198628
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "But it would be funny to someone who was watching us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1198788,
      "endMs": 1201708
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "No, Mom. He's right. Observe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1201868,
      "endMs": 1204549
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Oh, my. Lisa, go to your room. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1208709,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 6,
    "episode": 4
  }
}
